        <target state="translated">复选框组</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="8" name="CheckboxGroupDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Generate a group of checkboxes from an array.</source>
        <target state="translated">通过数组生成一组复选框。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="9" name="CheckedItemsBindingTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>CheckedItems binding</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckedItems 绑定</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="10" name="CheckedItemsBindingDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>CheckedItems uses TwoWay binding by default and stays in sync when the bound collection changes.</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckedItems 默认使用 TwoWay 绑定，并会在绑定集合变更时保持控件状态同步。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="11" name="CheckAllTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Check all</source>
        <target state="translated">全选</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="12" name="CheckAllDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>The indeterminate property can help you to achieve a 'check all' effect.</source>
        <target state="translated">indeterminate 属性可以帮助实现全选效果。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="13" name="UseWithGridTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Use with Grid</source>
        <target state="translated">结合 Grid 使用</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="14" name="UseWithGridDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>We can use Checkbox and Grid in Checkbox.Group, to implement complex layout.</source>
        <target state="translated">可以在 Checkbox.Group 中结合 Checkbox 和 Grid 实现复杂布局。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="15" name="PageSubtitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Collect binary or multiple choices from users.</source>
        <target state="translated">从用户处收集二元或多选选择。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="16" name="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>CheckBox supports checked, unchecked, indeterminate, disabled, controlled, grouped, and check-all states for forms and option lists.</source>
        <target state="translated">CheckBox 支持选中、未选中、半选、禁用、受控、分组和全选状态，适用于表单和选项列表。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
